<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Purpose</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Three tasks. Two need your input: the GHL sandbox test and the Amerworth base 1 visual. The third is for information only.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">GHL API</p></td></tr>
